{"id":"a80118b233c9c7df","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbunimodality.md","title":"唯一局部极大与完全单峰","display":"df-pbunimodality — 唯一局部极大与完全单峰","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbunimodality","aliases":["27-df-pbunimodality"],"display":"df-pbunimodality — 唯一局部极大与完全单峰","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.5, Definition 13.18","source_printed_pages":"606","source_pdf_pages":"630","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbunimodality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbunimodality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbunimodality — 唯一局部极大与完全单峰"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.5, Definition 13.18"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"606"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"630"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）；单射限制在下面两个类谓词中显式给出。对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S\\)</span>；空坐标积允许。</p>\n<p>待定义谓词符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBUnimax},\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBUnimax},\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F(S,a)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall i\\in S\\;(x_i=a_i)\\},\\qquad\nd:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad d(x,y)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n|x_i-y_i|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F(S,a)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall i\\in S\\;(x_i=a_i)\\},\\qquad\nd:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad d(x,y)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n|x_i-y_i|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\mathrm{LM}(f,U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in U:\\forall y\\in U\\;(d(x,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\mathrm{LM}(f,U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in U:\\forall y\\in U\\;(d(x,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBUnimax}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBUnimax}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S\\quad|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\mathcal F(S,a))|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S\\quad|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\mathcal F(S,a))|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>类谓词保留原书整节的单射要求；LM集合本身对任意实值f定义。面上的邻接只比较面内一点翻转，零维面有唯一点且自然满足条件。函数有唯一全局最大并不足以成为unimax；后者禁止其他局部峰。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（[[27-df-pseudobool]]）；单射限制在下面两个类谓词中显式给出。对$S\\subseteq[n]$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S$；空坐标积允许。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBUnimax},\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F(S,a)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n:\\forall i\\in S\\;(x_i=a_i)\\},\\qquad\nd:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\},\\qquad d(x,y)\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=1}^n|x_i-y_i|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^n\\quad\\mathrm{LM}(f,U)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in U:\\forall y\\in U\\;(d(x,y)=1\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBUnimax}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\{0,1\\}^n)|=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBCompletelyUnimodal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y))\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq[n]\\;\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^S\\quad|\\mathrm{LM}(f,\\mathcal F(S,a))|=1.","display":true}],"bytes":1860,"backlinks":[{"id":"ae8f51f4a773338a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}$，$f_M:\\{0,1\\}^2\\to\\mathbb R$；$d,\\mathrm{LM}$ 为 [[27-df-pbunimodality]] 中的集合构造，不要求单射。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbunimodality|df-pbunimodality — 唯一局部极大与完全单峰]]"},{"id":"d10bf908ef5dd0f3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原段落实际保留的修改主题包括投票指标的递增前提、零维距离记号、局部构造、索引及书内直接依赖。可对应阅读 [[27-df-swingbanzhaf]]、[[27-thm-swingchow]] 和 [[27-df-pbunimodality]]；本摘要不推断未列出的39个历史修改文件，也不凭数字3指定未给出的完整历史证据清单。"},{"id":"95eae96cf5d7c8ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\mathbb R$ 不必单射；$d,\\mathrm{LM}$ 见 [[27-df-pbunimodality]] 的形式定义。$q\\in\\mathbb N$，$x^0,\\ldots,x^q\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 且 $\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<q\\}\\;(d(x^k,x^{k+1})=1\\land f(x^{k+1})>f(x^k))$。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}